WEBVTT

00:00.608 --> 00:03.608
[Hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

00:03.608 --> 00:08.908
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:08.908 --> 00:10.174
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

00:10.174 --> 00:11.174
[carnival music]
[嘉年华音乐]

00:11.174 --> 00:12.874
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

00:12.874 --> 00:14.708
[munching]
[咀嚼]

00:14.708 --> 00:16.574
- Mm, mm, mm.
- 毫米，毫米，毫米。

00:16.574 --> 00:18.941
- Gah, gah, gah.
- 嘎嘎，嘎嘎。

00:18.941 --> 00:20.774
- Mmm! Isn't this
salt water taffy
- 嗯！这不是吗
盐水太妃糖

00:20.774 --> 00:22.174
just taffilicious?
只是太费力？

00:22.174 --> 00:24.408
- And stickerific!
- 还有贴纸！

00:24.408 --> 00:26.574
[both munching]
[两人都在咀嚼]

00:26.574 --> 00:28.374
[guitar tones]
[吉他音色]

00:28.374 --> 00:29.741
[laughs]
[笑]

00:29.741 --> 00:31.108
- Blah.
- 废话。

00:31.108 --> 00:32.108
[barking]
[叫声]

00:32.108 --> 00:33.208
[chewing efforts]
[咀嚼力度]

00:33.208 --> 00:36.241
Eh, eh.
[hums]
呃，呃。
[哼哼]

00:36.241 --> 00:37.808
[chewing efforts]
[咀嚼力度]

00:37.808 --> 00:38.908
- Blah!
- 废话！

00:38.908 --> 00:40.641
Ah!
[bell dings]
啊!
[铃声]

00:40.641 --> 00:42.341
[swallows, chews]
[吞咽、咀嚼]

00:42.341 --> 00:44.108
[straining, yells]
[alarm blares]
[用力，大喊]
[警报声]

00:44.108 --> 00:45.441
- What's the matter,
Patrick?
- 怎么了，
帕特里克？

00:45.441 --> 00:49.208
- I have a headache
inside of my tooth.
- 我头疼
在我的牙齿里面。

00:49.208 --> 00:50.941
- Maybe you should do
something about that.
- 也许你应该这样做
与此有关的一些事情。

00:50.941 --> 00:53.608
- Okay, I will.
- 好的，我会的。

00:53.608 --> 00:56.008
[snapping,
yelping]
[啪啪啪，
尖叫]

00:59.208 --> 01:00.374
- How does that help?
- 这有什么帮助？

01:00.374 --> 01:02.274
- Well, now that
my all-over hurts,
- 好吧，现在
我浑身疼痛，

01:02.274 --> 01:05.008
I'm not thinking
about my mouth.
我没有想
关于我的嘴。

01:05.008 --> 01:06.841
[throbbing]
Ow!
[悸动]
噢！

01:06.841 --> 01:09.308
I guess it didn't work.
[yells]
我猜它没有起作用。
[喊叫]

01:09.308 --> 01:10.408
[snapping]
- Oh! Oh!
[啪啪啪]
- 哦！哦！

01:10.408 --> 01:12.708
- Huh?
- [whimpering]
- 啊？
- [呜咽]

01:12.708 --> 01:14.241
Whoa! That's it!
哇！就是这样！

01:14.241 --> 01:16.441
I'm taking you
to the dentist, Patrick.
我带你去
去看牙医，帕特里克。

01:16.441 --> 01:19.574
- No way!
I've heard horror stories.
- 决不！
我听过恐怖故事。

01:19.574 --> 01:21.341
- Oh, don't worry,
Patrick.
-哦，别担心，
帕特里克.

01:21.341 --> 01:23.308
Dentists
are our friends.
牙医
是我们的朋友。

01:23.308 --> 01:25.474
Huh?
Patrick?
啊？
帕特里克？

01:25.474 --> 01:27.208
Patrick?
帕特里克？

01:30.108 --> 01:32.974
Oh.
哦。

01:32.974 --> 01:35.141
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

01:35.141 --> 01:36.308
Yah!
[crashing]
啊！
[崩溃]

01:36.308 --> 01:38.341
[giggles]
- And we have a winner.
[咯咯笑]
- 我们有一个胜利者。

01:38.341 --> 01:41.108
- [excitedly panting]
- [兴奋地喘气]

01:41.108 --> 01:43.374
Thank you.
- Aw, darn it.
谢谢。
- 噢，该死。

01:43.374 --> 01:47.174
[bubbles popping]
[breathing]
[气泡破裂]
[呼吸]

01:47.174 --> 01:49.741
Oh, boy!
Aren't dentists' offices fun?
哦，孩子！
牙医诊所不是很有趣吗？

01:49.741 --> 01:52.874
[gasps] Oh, they've got
colorful, wooden beads on wires!
[喘气]哦，他们有
电线上的彩色木珠！

01:52.874 --> 01:55.841
Mm! Ah.
Whoa! Look at it go!
毫米！啊。
哇！看看就走吧！

01:55.841 --> 01:58.308
- Slow down, SpongeBob!
- 慢点，海绵宝宝！

01:58.308 --> 02:00.341
This place is scary enough
without you
这个地方够恐怖的
没有你

02:00.341 --> 02:02.674
going crazy
with the beads!
发疯了
与珠子！

02:02.674 --> 02:05.408
[dramatic music]
[whimpering]
[戏剧音乐]
[呜咽]

02:05.408 --> 02:07.108
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

02:07.108 --> 02:08.974
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

02:08.974 --> 02:10.708
[boing]
Oh!
[嗡嗡声]
哦！

02:10.708 --> 02:12.541
[panting]
Ahh!
[气喘吁吁]
啊！

02:12.541 --> 02:14.008
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

02:14.008 --> 02:16.108
- And that was The Incidentals,
with a startling number
- 那就是《偶发事件》
有着惊人的数字

02:16.108 --> 02:17.574
called
"Dramatic Music Stings."
被称为
“戏剧性的音乐刺痛。”

02:17.574 --> 02:19.308
Comin' up,
here's The Spookers
来了，
这是幽灵党

02:19.308 --> 02:21.208
with a haunting little
tune called "Ominous."
带着令人难以忘怀的小
曲子叫《不祥》。

02:21.208 --> 02:23.208
- Patrick Star?
- 帕特里克·斯塔？

02:23.208 --> 02:25.808
We're ready for you now.
我们现在已经为您准备好了。

02:25.808 --> 02:26.808
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

02:26.808 --> 02:29.108
- [whines]
- [哀嚎]

02:29.108 --> 02:31.108
- Aw, come on, Patrick!
- No!
- 噢，来吧，帕特里克！
- 不！

02:31.108 --> 02:32.974
- The doctor
will fix you right up.
- 医生
会立即修复你。

02:32.974 --> 02:34.341
- Sit here, please.
- 请坐在这里。

02:34.341 --> 02:36.508
Dr. Mundane will be
right with you.
Mundane 博士将会
就在你身边。

02:40.241 --> 02:42.674
- Ahh!
[teeth chattering]
- 啊！
[牙齿打战]

02:42.674 --> 02:45.474
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:45.474 --> 02:48.208
- Agnes, please turn down
that radio.
- 艾格尼丝，请拒绝
那个收音机。

02:48.208 --> 02:49.508
[music stops]
[音乐停止]

02:51.374 --> 02:53.541
I'm Dr. Beige Mundane.
我是米奇·穆丹博士。

02:53.541 --> 02:55.408
You must be Patrick Star.
你一定是帕特里克·明星。

02:55.408 --> 02:57.208
What seems to be
the problem?
看起来是什么
问题是什么？

02:57.208 --> 02:58.608
- No problem.
I was just leaving.
- 没问题。
我正要离开。

02:58.608 --> 03:00.108
- [grunts]
No, Patrick! Sit!
- [咕哝]
不，帕特里克！坐！

03:00.108 --> 03:02.274
[water spraying]
- [blubbering]
[喷水]
- [哭泣]

03:02.274 --> 03:03.808
- Good boy.
- 好孩子。

03:03.808 --> 03:05.908
Ow!
噢！

03:05.908 --> 03:07.808
[laughs]
[笑]

03:07.808 --> 03:10.108
- Let's take a look
in your mouth.
- 让我们看一下
在你嘴里。

03:10.108 --> 03:12.174
Open wide please.
请张开。

03:12.174 --> 03:13.641
[ship horn blares]
[船喇叭声]

03:13.641 --> 03:15.308
- Mm-hmm.
I see the problem.
- 嗯嗯。
我看到了问题所在。

03:15.308 --> 03:16.841
- [struggling]
- Your friend here
- [挣扎]
- 你的朋友在这里

03:16.841 --> 03:18.808
still has a baby tooth.
仍然有一颗乳牙。

03:18.808 --> 03:21.941
- Ooh, I wanna see!
- [gulps]
- 哦，我想看看！
- [吞咽]

03:21.941 --> 03:24.308
[gagging]
[bats chirping]
[作呕]
[蝙蝠鸣叫]

03:24.308 --> 03:27.174
[snoring]
- Aw!
[打鼾]
- 噢！

03:27.174 --> 03:30.508
Coochie coo!
- [crying]
咕咕咕！
- [哭泣]

03:30.508 --> 03:33.941
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:33.941 --> 03:35.508
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:35.508 --> 03:38.108
- I still have a baby tooth?
- 我还有乳牙吗？

03:38.108 --> 03:40.008
- Yes, and the pain is
coming from
- 是的，痛苦是
来自

03:40.008 --> 03:43.874
your adult tooth trying to push
your baby tooth out of the way.
你的恒牙试图推动
你的乳牙不碍事。

03:43.874 --> 03:45.108
[straining]
[紧张]

03:45.108 --> 03:46.641
- [gasps]
That's not right!
- [喘气]
那是不对的！

03:46.641 --> 03:48.474
- It's the natural way
of things.
- 这是自然的方式
的事情。

03:48.474 --> 03:50.474
If you want the pain
to go away,
如果你想要痛苦
走开，

03:50.474 --> 03:56.241
then I need to extract
the tooth.
然后我需要提取
牙齿。

03:56.241 --> 03:59.341
- You leave my baby tooth alone,
you monster!
- 你别管我的乳牙，
你这个怪物！

03:59.341 --> 04:01.541
Zoom!
- Patrick, come back!
飞涨！
- 帕特里克，回来吧！

04:01.541 --> 04:02.341
Oh!
哦！

04:02.341 --> 04:04.108
Oh, oh, eh, eh.
哦，哦，呃，呃。

04:04.108 --> 04:05.241
- Nobody is going
to tell me
- 没有人会去
告诉我

04:05.241 --> 04:07.374
what to do
with my baby tooth.
该怎么办
和我的乳牙。

04:07.374 --> 04:09.741
This tooth is stayin'
in my mouth!
这颗牙还留着
在我嘴里！

04:09.741 --> 04:11.474
- Okay, Patrick,
but that means
- 好吧，帕特里克，
但这意味着

04:11.474 --> 04:13.808
your tooth won't be going
to Tooth Island.
你的牙齿不会脱落
到牙岛。

04:13.808 --> 04:16.974
- Tooth Island?
- Yeah, Tooth Island!
- 牙岛？
- 是的，牙岛！

04:16.974 --> 04:19.341
It's where the Tooth Fairy
takes all the baby teeth
这里就是牙仙子的地方
拿掉所有乳牙

04:19.341 --> 04:20.608
that are left
under pillows.
剩下的
枕头下。

04:20.608 --> 04:22.374
Tooth island
is a wonderful place,
牙岛
是一个美妙的地方，

04:22.374 --> 04:23.874
where teeth can be free.
牙齿可以自由的地方。

04:23.874 --> 04:26.108
They can soak in
the Calcium Pools all day
他们可以浸泡在
全天钙池

04:26.108 --> 04:28.574
or sleep in the comfort
of the Pink Gum Trees.
或睡在舒适的地方
的粉红橡胶树。

04:28.574 --> 04:30.108
They get to swing on
Floss Vines
他们继续摇摆
牙线藤

04:30.108 --> 04:32.941
and never, ever have to
worry about cavities.
并且永远、永远必须
担心蛀牙。

04:32.941 --> 04:34.508
[all beckoning]
[一切都在召唤]

04:34.508 --> 04:36.008
Of course,
I guess your baby tooth
当然，
我猜你的乳牙

04:36.008 --> 04:37.874
could be happy
in your mouth,
可以很高兴
在你嘴里，

04:37.874 --> 04:40.108
all alone, by itself.
独自一人。

04:40.108 --> 04:43.374
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

04:44.341 --> 04:45.841
- I don't care, SpongeBob.
- 我不在乎，海绵宝宝。

04:45.841 --> 04:48.308
I know what's best
for my tooth.
我知道什么是最好的
为了我的牙齿。

04:48.308 --> 04:51.108
I can make it happy.
我可以让它幸福。

04:51.108 --> 04:52.741
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

04:52.741 --> 04:53.808
[crying]
[哭泣]

04:53.808 --> 04:55.841
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

04:55.841 --> 04:58.408
Ahh.
- [crying]
啊。
- [哭泣]

04:58.408 --> 05:04.408
* Rock-a-bye, baby,
on the tree top *
*摇滚再见，宝贝，
在树顶上*

05:04.408 --> 05:06.274
[crying continues]
[哭泣继续]

05:06.274 --> 05:08.441
[keys jingling]
- Ah.
[钥匙叮当作响]
- 啊。

05:08.441 --> 05:11.474
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:11.474 --> 05:12.608
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:12.608 --> 05:14.141
- [laughs]
Oops.
- [笑]
哎呀。

05:14.141 --> 05:16.941
[boink]
- [cries]
[乱搞]
- [哭声]

05:16.941 --> 05:18.441
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

05:19.341 --> 05:20.841
[bites, chews]
[咬、咀嚼]

05:20.841 --> 05:22.374
- Oh!
- 哦！

05:22.374 --> 05:24.308
Ohh!
哦！

05:24.308 --> 05:25.708
[horn blares]
[screams]
[喇叭声]
[尖叫声]

05:25.708 --> 05:28.108
[pained grunt]
Ow!
[痛苦的咕噜声]
噢！

05:28.108 --> 05:30.341
- Hmm. My friendship sense
is tingling.
- 唔。我的友谊感
是刺痛。

05:30.341 --> 05:32.374
Patrick must be in
trouble!
帕特里克一定在
麻烦！

05:32.374 --> 05:34.174
- Oh. Ooh!
- 哦。哦！

05:34.174 --> 05:37.708
- What's the matter, pal?
- Nothing! Just, uh--
-怎么了，朋友？
- 没有什么！只是，呃——

05:37.708 --> 05:40.308
Practicing being a seal.
[laughs]
练习成为海豹。
[笑]

05:40.308 --> 05:43.308
[imitates seal barking]
[模仿海豹吠叫]

05:45.674 --> 05:47.541
- Hm!
- 嗯！

05:47.541 --> 05:50.174
- [barking]
Ow!
- [吠叫]
噢！

05:50.174 --> 05:52.208
- Patrick,
Dr. Mundane always says,
- 帕特里克，
Mundane 博士总是说，

05:52.208 --> 05:54.608
"If you can't bite,
things ain't right."
“如果你咬不动，
事情不对劲。”

05:54.608 --> 05:58.241
- Okay, SpongeBob.
I guess I have to
- 好吧，海绵宝宝。
我想我必须

05:58.241 --> 06:00.608
get my tooth
to the Tooth Fairy.
得到我的牙齿
到牙仙子。

06:00.608 --> 06:03.408
- Ha, you rube.
There is no such thing
- 哈，你这个乡巴佬。
没有这样的事

06:03.408 --> 06:05.541
as the Tooth Fairy.
- Ah!
作为牙仙子。
- 啊！

06:05.541 --> 06:07.841
Squidward!
- It's all a bunch of
章鱼哥！
- 都是一堆

06:07.841 --> 06:09.108
made up baloney.
编造的胡言乱语。

06:09.108 --> 06:10.674
- It is not baloney!
- 这不是胡说八道！

06:10.674 --> 06:13.574
- It is baloney!
- Who's got baloney?
- 这是胡说八道！
- 谁有胡言乱语？

06:13.574 --> 06:15.574
- [sighs] There is no
baloney!
- [叹气]没有
胡说八道！

06:15.574 --> 06:17.874
Just like there is
no Tooth Fairy.
就像有一样
没有牙仙子。

06:17.874 --> 06:20.008
In fact, if you could
prove there were
事实上，如果你能
证明有

06:20.008 --> 06:22.574
a Tooth Fairy,
I would eat, oh--
牙仙子，
我会吃，哦——

06:22.574 --> 06:24.008
a bucket of chum!
一桶密友！

06:24.008 --> 06:25.441
both: Ew!
两人：呃！

06:25.441 --> 06:26.808
- Squidward, why would
you want to do that?
- 章鱼哥，为什么要
你想这么做吗？

06:26.808 --> 06:29.108
- I said I would,
only if there was
- 我说过我会的
仅当有

06:29.108 --> 06:31.874
a Tooth Fairy, and since
there isn't a Tooth Fairy,
牙仙子，从那时起
没有牙仙子，

06:31.874 --> 06:35.374
I will never have to eat
a bucket of chum.
我永远不需要吃饭
一桶密友

06:35.374 --> 06:36.574
- Patrick,
I've been your friend
- 帕特里克，
我一直是你的朋友

06:36.574 --> 06:37.674
for a long time.
许久。

06:37.674 --> 06:39.108
I would never
lie to you.
我永远不会
对你撒谎。

06:39.108 --> 06:40.774
You need Dr. Mundane's help
so you can
你需要 Mundane 博士的帮助
所以你可以

06:40.774 --> 06:42.174
get your tooth
to the Tooth Fairy.
得到你的牙齿
到牙仙子。

06:42.174 --> 06:45.974
- That's okay, SpongeBob.
I think I can manage.
- 没关系，海绵宝宝。
我想我可以应付。

06:45.974 --> 06:47.174
Hmm, yah!
嗯，是啊！

06:47.174 --> 06:48.441
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

06:48.441 --> 06:52.108
[blender whirrs]
[搅拌机的嗡嗡声]

06:52.108 --> 06:54.108
[snorts]
[哼哼]

06:54.108 --> 06:56.108
Ahh.
啊。

06:56.108 --> 06:57.508
[splat]
[cries]
[啪嗒]
[哭声]

06:57.508 --> 06:58.574
- Ahh!
[alarm bell ringing]
- 啊！
[警钟长鸣]

06:58.574 --> 06:59.808
[grunts]
- You see, Patrick,
[咕哝]
- 你看，帕特里克，

06:59.808 --> 07:01.408
we have got to
get that tooth out.
我们必须
把那颗牙拔掉。

07:01.408 --> 07:03.208
- You'll have to
catch me first!
- 你必须这样做
先抓住我吧！

07:03.208 --> 07:04.674
Oh!
- Patrick, wait!
哦！
- 帕特里克，等等！

07:04.674 --> 07:06.641
- Ha ha,
Tooth Fairy.
- 哈哈，
牙仙子.

07:06.641 --> 07:08.741
What a couple
of molar morons.
多么一对啊
磨牙白痴。

07:08.741 --> 07:10.474
[crashing]
Ow!
[崩溃]
噢！

07:10.474 --> 07:13.374
[panting, screaming]
[气喘吁吁，尖叫]

07:13.374 --> 07:17.608
[growling, howling]
[instrumental country music]
[咆哮，嚎叫]
[乡村器乐]

07:20.741 --> 07:23.374
- [gasps] The worms.
Oh, oh, no!
- [喘气] 蠕虫。
哦，哦，不！

07:23.374 --> 07:25.108
[barking, growling]
[吠叫，咆哮]

07:25.108 --> 07:26.474
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:26.474 --> 07:27.774
Oh!
哦！

07:27.774 --> 07:29.441
[growling]
[fence rattles]
[咆哮]
[栅栏嘎嘎作响]

07:29.441 --> 07:30.874
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:30.874 --> 07:32.574
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:32.574 --> 07:36.441
[blows]
[splashing]
[打击]
[溅]

07:36.441 --> 07:37.441
[slurping]
[发出声音]

07:37.441 --> 07:40.441
[barking]
[叫声]

07:41.841 --> 07:43.108
[spits]
[吐口水]

07:43.108 --> 07:44.908
[screams]
[thud]
[尖叫声]
[砰]

07:44.908 --> 07:46.608
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:46.608 --> 07:48.341
Not wanted.
不想要的。

07:48.341 --> 07:49.708
That fixes it.
这样就解决了。

07:49.708 --> 07:51.274
[barking]
[whimpers]
[吠叫]
[呜咽]

07:51.274 --> 07:53.308
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:53.308 --> 07:55.108
Oh.
哦。

07:55.108 --> 07:56.941
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:56.941 --> 07:58.774
[jaws snapping]
[下巴张开]

07:58.774 --> 07:59.574
Ahh.
啊。

07:59.574 --> 08:00.941
[barking]
[叫声]

08:00.941 --> 08:03.541
- Mipsey, Pipsey,
you bad girls!
- 米普西，皮普西，
你们这些坏女孩！

08:03.541 --> 08:06.241
You get back
on this leash.
你回来
在这条皮带上。

08:06.241 --> 08:07.874
[whining]
[抱怨]

08:07.874 --> 08:09.841
- Well, you may have
called off your worms,
- 嗯，你可能有
叫走你的蠕虫，

08:09.841 --> 08:12.674
but I'm not coming down.
- Patrick, they weren't mine.
但我不会下来。
- 帕特里克，他们不是我的。

08:12.674 --> 08:15.808
- A likely story.
- [sighs]
- 一个可能的故事。
- [叹气]

08:15.808 --> 08:17.874
Patrick, can I show you
something?
帕特里克，我可以给你看吗
东西？

08:17.874 --> 08:19.974
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:19.974 --> 08:21.641
- What's that?
- It's a scrap book
- 那是什么？
- 这是一本剪贴簿

08:21.641 --> 08:23.241
of all my baby teeth.
我所有的乳牙。

08:23.241 --> 08:24.474
Heh, that was a good one.
呵呵，那是一件好事。

08:24.474 --> 08:25.941
I remember every tooth.
我记得每一颗牙齿。

08:25.941 --> 08:27.708
Even though they're no longer
in my mouth,
尽管他们不再
在我嘴里，

08:27.708 --> 08:30.141
I still keep the memory
of them in my heart.
我还保留着记忆
他们在我心里。

08:30.141 --> 08:33.341
- [laughs] I thought you kept
them in the scrapbook.
- [笑]我以为你保留了
他们在剪贴簿里。

08:33.341 --> 08:35.474
- Patrick, don't you think
your baby tooth
- 帕特里克，你不觉得吗
你的乳牙

08:35.474 --> 08:38.041
wants to see all his old
friends on Tooth Island?
想看看他所有的旧事
牙岛上的朋友吗？

08:38.041 --> 08:39.441
- Don't listen to him!
- 别听他的！

08:39.441 --> 08:42.774
I still have all my baby teeth,
and look at me!
我的乳牙还在
看着我！

08:42.774 --> 08:44.574
Ahh!
[maniacal laughter]
啊！
[疯狂的笑声]

08:44.574 --> 08:45.641
[both exclaim]
[两人惊呼]

08:45.641 --> 08:47.508
- Okay, SpongeBob,
we can go.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，
我们可以走了。

08:47.508 --> 08:48.941
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

08:48.941 --> 08:50.941
[mechanical whirring,
squeaking]
[机械呼呼声，
吱吱声]

08:50.941 --> 08:54.141
I'm ready, Doc.
Do what you have to do.
我准备好了，博士。
做你必须做的事。

08:54.141 --> 08:55.574
Ahh.
[yanking]
啊。
[猛拉]

08:55.574 --> 08:57.808
- I'm done.
- 我受够了。

08:57.808 --> 09:00.108
- That's it?
- That's it.
- 就是这样？
- 就是这样。

09:00.108 --> 09:01.441
- Aw.
- 噢。

09:01.441 --> 09:03.908
Aw, you're going under
my pillow
噢，你快要沦陷了
我的枕头

09:03.908 --> 09:07.641
so you can go
to Tooth Island, my sweet boy.
所以你可以走了
去牙岛吧，我可爱的孩子。

09:07.641 --> 09:10.274
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

09:10.274 --> 09:13.574
[snoring]
[打鼾]

09:17.108 --> 09:18.141
[grunts, gasps]
[咕哝声，喘气声]

09:18.141 --> 09:20.508
SpongeBob?
- Ha! I was right!
海绵宝宝？
- 哈！我是对的！

09:20.508 --> 09:22.941
The Tooth Fairy
isn't real.
牙仙子
不是真的。

09:22.941 --> 09:25.108
- Oh, SpongeBob.
- 哦，海绵宝宝。

09:25.108 --> 09:26.574
- Patrick,
you don't understand!
- 帕特里克，
你不明白！

09:26.574 --> 09:28.641
I'm just helping
to get your tooth
我只是帮忙
得到你的牙齿

09:28.641 --> 09:31.141
to the Tooth Fairy.
- Oh, that's a good one.
到牙仙子。
- 哦，那是一件好事。

09:31.141 --> 09:33.908
- It's true!
- How can I believe you?
- 这是真的！
- 我怎么相信你？

09:33.908 --> 09:38.541
Oh, the lies!
The chicanery! [sobs]
哦，谎言！
诡计！ [抽泣]

09:38.541 --> 09:40.374
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:40.374 --> 09:43.108
Look at how betrayed
Patrick feels!
看看被背叛的程度
帕特里克感觉！

09:43.108 --> 09:45.708
Oh, this was totally
worth staying up all night.
哦，这完全是
值得熬夜。

09:45.708 --> 09:47.541
- You don't believe
there's a Tooth Fairy?
- 你不相信
有牙仙子吗？

09:47.541 --> 09:50.774
Well, follow me
and I'll show ya.
嗯，跟我来
我会告诉你。

09:50.774 --> 09:53.174
Behold, the Tooth Ferry!
看哪，牙轮！

09:53.174 --> 09:55.108
[ship horn blares]
[船喇叭声]

09:55.108 --> 09:56.674
This is where parents
and friends
这里是父母的地方
和朋友

09:56.674 --> 09:59.441
take teeth so they can be
ferried to Tooth Island.
拔掉牙齿，这样它们就可以
乘渡轮前往牙岛。

09:59.441 --> 10:02.108
- There really is
a Tooth Ferry!
- 确实有
牙齿渡轮！

10:02.108 --> 10:03.641
- Of course.
- 当然。

10:03.641 --> 10:05.608
- Hm--wha!
- 嗯--哇！

10:05.608 --> 10:06.741
- All aboard!
- 全部上车！

10:09.108 --> 10:12.408
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

10:12.408 --> 10:14.108
- Uh, uh, oh.
- 呃，呃，哦。

10:14.108 --> 10:15.941
Uh-huh, hello!
嗯哼，你好！

10:15.941 --> 10:18.008
- [restrained crying]
- [克制住哭泣]

10:18.008 --> 10:22.741
[horn blares]
[cheering]
[喇叭声]
[欢呼]

10:22.741 --> 10:25.774
[blows nose]
[擤鼻子]

10:25.774 --> 10:27.541
- Oh, here.
This is yours.
- 哦，在这里。
这是你的。

10:27.541 --> 10:28.941
- Could you wait till
I'm asleep
- 你能等到吗
我睡着了

10:28.941 --> 10:31.241
and put it
under my pillow?
并把它
在我的枕头下？

10:31.241 --> 10:33.174
- Mm, sure Patrick.
Anything for a pal.
- 嗯，当然帕特里克。
为了朋友什么都可以。

10:33.174 --> 10:35.741
[cash register dings]
- Hey! Where do you think
[收银机叮叮声]
- 嘿！你认为哪里

10:35.741 --> 10:37.674
you're going,
chum chewer?
你要去，
密友咀嚼者？

10:37.674 --> 10:39.841
- [groans] Ah!
Hey, come on!
- [呻吟]啊！
嘿，来吧！

10:39.841 --> 10:42.141
This is just a big
misunderstanding!
这只是一个大
误会！

10:42.141 --> 10:45.008
Ferry, fairy:
They're two different words
渡轮，仙女：
这是两个不同的词

10:45.008 --> 10:46.708
that just happen
to sound alike!
那只是发生
听起来很像！

10:46.708 --> 10:49.208
- Open wide, Squidward!
- No.
- 张开吧，章鱼哥！
- 不。

10:49.208 --> 10:51.141
[teeth screaming]
[牙齿尖叫]

10:51.141 --> 10:55.308
[panicked yelling]
[horn blares]
[惊慌失措的叫喊]
[喇叭声]

[惊慌失措的叫喊]
[喇叭声]